# Build output
bin/
obj/

# Visual Studio / Rider
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs

# Logs / temp
*.log
tmp/

# OS
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# NOTE: native/x64/bass.dll and native/x64/bass_aac.dll are intentionally tracked —
# they are required native dependencies copied to the output at build time.

# Local embedding model is large (~90 MB) — fetched on setup, not committed.
# vocab.txt is small and IS tracked.
MlAssets/*.onnx

# Design-review screenshots (~26 MB) are inputs to the audit, not deliverables — the
# audit, brief and token summary in doc/design-review/ are what we keep. Also kept out
# of history deliberately: the Options screenshot showed a live API key before it was
# painted over, and a redaction that turns out imperfect is permanent once committed.
doc/design-review/screenshots/
doc/design-review/composites/
doc/design-review/audit-text.txt

# Installer output (build-installer.ps1)
build/
